{"id":"97f80cc5c73f0d60","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-abstract-dual-incompleteness.md","title":"Dual Incompleteness via Refutability","display":"thm-abstract-dual-incompleteness — Dual Incompleteness via Refutability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-abstract-dual-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-abstract-dual-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-abstract-dual-incompleteness — Dual Incompleteness via Refutability","source":"第 I 章 p. 11，Theorem 1°（PDF 28）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-lem-abstract-diagonal]]","[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]","[[92-df-diagonal-pullback]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-abstract-dual-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-abstract-dual-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-abstract-dual-incompleteness — Dual Incompleteness via Refutability"},{"key":"source","html":"第 I 章 p. 11，Theorem 1°（PDF 28）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ae549c14f89182f\" href=\"?note=2ae549c14f89182f\" title=\"92-lem-abstract-diagonal\">92-lem-abstract-diagonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" href=\"?note=8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" title=\"92-df-abstract-expressibility\">92-df-abstract-expressibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"73782856c9b2f46a\" href=\"?note=73782856c9b2f46a\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-pullback\">92-df-diagonal-pullback</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" href=\"?note=8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" title=\"92-df-abstract-expressibility\">92-df-abstract-expressibility</a>的性质；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[R]\">\\(R_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[R]\\)</span>，星号是对角逆像。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}dual\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}((R_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#})_{\\mathcal L}^{*})\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists X\\in S\\;(X\\notin T\\land X\\notin P\\land X\\notin R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}dual\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}((R_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#})_{\\mathcal L}^{*})\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists X\\in S\\;(X\\notin T\\land X\\notin P\\land X\\notin R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>引理构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in T\\leftrightarrow X\\in R\">\\(X\\in T\\leftrightarrow X\\in R\\)</span>。正确性禁止真句在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 内，所以二者均不成立；又 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq T\">\\(P\\subseteq T\\)</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\notin P\">\\(X\\notin P\\)</span>。见证是假的而不可反驳，与 GT 的真而不可证见证不同。这里不需补集封闭条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{G2}\">\\(\\mathrm{G2}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 I 章 p. 11，Theorem 1°（PDF 28）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-lem-abstract-diagonal","status":"resolved","id":"2ae549c14f89182f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-abstract-diagonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-abstract-expressibility","status":"resolved","id":"8dcd8ee3e47cef44","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-diagonal-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"73782856c9b2f46a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonal-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-abstract-expressibility","status":"resolved","id":"8dcd8ee3e47cef44","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}$、$\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}$ 是[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]的性质；$R_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[R]$，星号是对角逆像。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"R_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[R]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}dual\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}((R_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#})_{\\mathcal L}^{*})\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists X\\in S\\;(X\\notin T\\land X\\notin P\\land X\\notin R).","display":true},{"tex":"X\\in T\\leftrightarrow X\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"X\\notin P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{G2}","display":false}],"bytes":1486,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-godel-tarski]]利用正确性与可表达类的条件得到真而未判定句；[[92-thm-abstract-tarski]]说明真句码集的对角补集不可表达；[[92-thm-abstract-dual-incompleteness]]给出假而未判定的对偶版本。此层无需先构造 PA、递归函数或 HBL 谓词。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-254","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-dual-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["2ae549c14f89182f","8dcd8ee3e47cef44","73782856c9b2f46a"]}